Blueprint name: holidays
Rule: /api/holidays/details -> holidays.get_holidays ['GET', 'HEAD', 'OPTIONS']
With the Redis copy: [{'date': '2026-10-02', 'description': 'Gandhi Jayanti'}, {'date': '2026-10-20', 'description': 'Diwali'}]
Without it, from MongoDB: [{'date': '2026-12-25', 'description': 'Christmas'}]
list_collection: 200 [{"date": "2026-12-25", "description": "Christmas"}]
